WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.044
[Reflective 80s Rock Intro — Flute and New Wave Synthesizer Harmonize]

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:40.200
I'm trying to find that boy I knew

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.000
In shades of brilliant white and blue

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.500
The one who thought he had it made

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.851
Before the colors start to fade

00:00:53.891 --> 00:00:58.500
He's still in here, a distant ghost

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.500
The one I miss and fear the most

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.538
A part of me is lost, it's true

00:01:06.598 --> 00:01:11.500
A space that was reserved for you... Olivia

00:01:13.913 --> 00:01:19.000
But the scars remain, a map to trace

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.800
And they have found their proper place

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.500
I'm standing on a different floor

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.740
Than I was standing on before

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.500
And I can hear a brand new sound

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.500
On this new and solid ground

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.000
The echo of a worried flute

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.500
A synthesizer's loving root

00:01:48.500 --> 00:02:09.142
[Flute and Synthesizer Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:09.142 --> 00:02:13.800
I'm learning how to trust again

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:18.500
To let the gentle sunlight in

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:23.500
I'm learning that a helping hand

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:28.412
Can help a broken boy to stand

00:02:28.552 --> 00:02:32.500
I'm learning that a home can be

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.780
A fortress built for only me

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:41.669
By two strong women, brave and true

00:02:41.709 --> 00:02:46.500
Who know exactly what to do

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.500
'Cause the scars remain, a map to trace

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.500
And they have found their proper place

00:02:54.528 --> 00:02:59.955
I'm standing on a different floor

00:03:00.036 --> 00:03:05.500
Than I was standing on before

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.347
And I can hear a brand new sound

00:03:09.347 --> 00:03:13.000
On this new and solid ground

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.754
The echo of a worried flute

00:03:15.754 --> 00:03:19.500
A synthesizer's loving root

00:03:19.500 --> 00:04:34.920
[Instrumental Outro — Flute and Synthesizer Trade Melodies Over Rock Beat]
